 are making  changes and the federal government's  trying to correct  or trying to prevent those changes from  hurting voter turnout it's unfortunate  and hopefully they figure this thing out  molly  it was not true that this was this was  an election without problems and in fact  as people have moved to to mail in  balloting people need to have  confidence that it's not just that  people are free to vote but that also  it's difficult  to cheat and so this is a very salient  issue and republicans are finding that  despite all of the propaganda press in  favor of democrats plan  it's not very popular with the people  and so they're happy to keep talking  about it because  they know that the voters really do  appreciate basic election integrity  measures  such as voter id jason file thought from  you  there is no voting rights problem in  this country there was record turnout  among asians and hispanics in 2020  among blacks it was the third highest  turnout after 2008 and 2012 and of  course barack  obama was on the ballot this is not  about voting rights this is a power grab  from the federal government  all right we need to leave it there

